{"source_page": "https://www.facebook.com/negrospowerph", "title": "SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION: JULY 26, 2026", "post_text": "SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION: JULY 26, 2026\nGinapahibalo sang Negros Power ang mga konsumidores nga may ara sang natalana nga power interruption sa July 26, 2026 (Sunday).\nIni kabahin sang 5-year rehabilitation kag modernization plan sang Negros Power agud malikawan ang mga wala ginalauman kag mas lapnagon nga power interruptions kag mangin reliable ang distribution system sang aton elektrisidad.\nYari ang mga detalye sang scheduled power interruption:\nDate: July 26, 2026 (Sunday)\nReason: Massive Installation of rubber inserts, insulator replacement Distribution Transformer & Fuse Cut Out covers, and fuse coordination along Negros South Rd. Bago.\nTime & Affected Areas:\n6:00AM to 3:00PM\nWhole of HF1 - Whole of HF1 - From Lag-asan or Hilangban Substation, Brgy. Lag-asan, Bago City College, Prk. Kapahuan 1 & 2, Bago City Hospital, Prk. Santan, San Esteban Phase 2, Sta. Catalina Subdivision, Brgy. Sampinit, San Sebastian Village, Brgy. Balingasag (Prk. Potat, Prk. Rosal, Prk. Violetas), San Gabriel Subd., Brgy. Sampinit, Villa Cristeta Ph 3, Southbay Subdivision, South Valley, HDA. Yusay, portion of Brgy. Calumangan until Bangga Ma. Morena, Brgy. Calumanggan, Purok Batad, Bago City Hospital.\nNote: We may energize earlier than the scheduled time once the rehabilitation activity is completed.\nMadamo gid nga salamat sa inyo nga pag hangop.\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService", "posted": "58m", "posted_at": "2026-07-23 13:44:16", "post_date": "2026-07-23", "has_image": true, "image_urls": ["https://scontent.fceb6-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/753145774_122227441034048473_4633652591889529347_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_tt6&cstp=mx1080x1080&ctp=s590x590&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=127cfc&_nc_ohc=lgAfMlelq2cQ7kNvwEFG4jF&_nc_oc=AdrJa7ezY9IaqCrdrO9_UAtS7g3H79PBBYjG8nMdjKTzaBhXMirUKzCMnTqAsmRH_-A&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scont